Ep5: Playwright In-built Locators:

getByRole() = Locates elements by ARIA role and accessible name.

getByText() = Locates elements by visible text.

getByLabel() = Locates form controls by their associated label.

getByPlaceholder() = Locates input elements by placeholder text.

getByAltText() = Locates elements by their alt text.

getByTitle() = Locates elements by their title attribute.

getByTestId() = Locates elements by their test ID attribute.





getByRole() = page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Login' })

getByText() = page.getByText('Welcome')

getByLabel() = page.getByLabel('Email address')

getByPlaceholder() = page.getByPlaceholder('Enter email')

getByAltText() = page.getByAltText('Company logo')

getByTitle() = page.getByTitle('Close')

getByTestId() = page.getByTestId('submit-button')

